# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Never commit Digitone project, pattern or sound data.
#
# The test corpus is real music and stays private — see test/corpus.ts, which
# locates it at run time via DN_CORPUS or a sibling folder. These rules are a
# safety net so an accidental copy cannot be committed.
#
# Purpose-built example files created specifically to document the tool are the
# only exception, and must be added with `git add -f` after a deliberate check.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.dnprj
*.dn2prj
*.syx
*.dtprj
*.dt2prj
*.dnsnd
*.dn2pst
00_Examples/
99_HardwareTest/
